## Why This Is Asked
Assesses understanding of B2B guest access lifecycle, least-privilege, and simple automation.

## Key Concepts
- Azure AD B2B guest invites
- Group-based access to a single resource
- Conditional Access MFA for guests
- Expiration and rollback mechanisms
- Auditing and verification

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo code for revoking guest access via Graph API
async function revokeGuestAccess(guestEmail) {
  // remove from group
  await removeMemberFromGroup(guestEmail, 'Partner_SharePoint_Access');
  // clean up guest if orphaned
  await deleteGuestUserIfOrphan(guestEmail);
}
```

